msgstr "支持 PDF、JPG、JPEG、PNG。单文件最大 10 MB，单次总计最大 25 MB。本批文件使用所选凭证类型，可分批上传其他类型。"

msgid "Documents may be added later. Payment status and supporting documents are independent."
